graph LR
    User[测试人员或面试官] --> Web[React 工作台<br/>Ant Design + Vite]
    Web --> Api[Spring Boot REST API<br/>Knife4j 接口文档]

    subgraph Backend[后端核心模块]
        Doc[文档模块<br/>文本录入 文件上传 解析状态]
        Parser[解析模块<br/>Apache Tika 文本提取 元数据 分块]
        Ai[AI 模块<br/>Prompt 编排 需求抽取 用例生成]
        Case[用例模块<br/>草稿 正式用例 步骤]
        Review[评审模块<br/>人工编辑 确认 驳回 记录]
        Diff[Diff 分析模块<br/>代码变更 风险识别 补充用例]
        Export[导出模块<br/>JSON Excel]
    end

    Api --> Doc
    Doc --> Parser
    Parser --> Ai
    Ai --> Case
    Case --> Review
    Review --> Export
    Diff --> Case

    subgraph Storage[数据与文件存储]
        MariaDB[(MariaDB<br/>业务表 Prompt 版本 生成记录)]
        Uploads[本地上传目录<br/>data/uploads]
    end

    subgraph External[外部能力]
        LLM[OpenAI 兼容大模型<br/>OpenAI Qwen DeepSeek]
        Repo[Git 仓库<br/>源分支 目标分支 Diff]
    end

    Doc --> Uploads
    Doc --> MariaDB
    Parser --> MariaDB
    Ai --> LLM
    Ai --> MariaDB
    Case --> MariaDB
    Review --> MariaDB
    Export --> MariaDB
    Diff --> Repo
    Diff --> MariaDB
